      "id": "claim_4f9b30d0f76d4b16b1fe6ecc2e393112",
      "statement": "$STEPPATH is resolved by the external cli-utils step package during step.Init() before any command runs; it defaults to $HOME/.step, is overridable via the STEPPATH environment variable, and step path / step path --base / step path --profile print the resolved values.",
