      "statement": "The step ca bootstrap help text places defaults.json at $STEPPATH/configs/defaults.json, but the code writes to step.DefaultsFile() and the step ca health help text locates it at $STEPPATH/config/defaults.json; the code path is authoritative and the configs/ spelling in the bootstrap help text appears stale.",
