      "id": "claim_5daca394f84640dc8d340b96bf1a5fc2",
      "statement": "step ca bootstrap's bootstrap() helper validates the root fingerprint while downloading via client.Root(fingerprint), normalizes the CA URL to https, writes the root to pki.GetRootCAPath() mode 0600, and writes a bootstrapConfig JSON (keys ca-url, fingerprint, root, optional redirect-url, provisioner, min-password-length) to step.DefaultsFile() mode 0644.",
